ockets\">Houston Rockets</a></span> season</th></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\"><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_current_NBA_head_coaches\" title=\"List of current NBA head coaches\">Head coach</a></th><td class=\"infobox-data agent\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ime_Udoka\" title=\"Ime Udoka\">Ime Udoka</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\"><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_NBA_team_presidents\" title=\"List of NBA team presidents\">President</a></th><td class=\"infobox-data\">Gretchen Sheirr</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\"><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_NBA_general_managers\" title=\"List of NBA general managers\">General manager</a></th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rafael_Stone\" title=\"Rafael Stone\">Rafael Stone</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\"><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_NBA_team_owners\" title=\"List of NBA team owners\">Owner</a></th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tilman_Fertitta\" title=\"Tilman Fertitta\">Tilman Fertitta</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\"><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_NBA_arenas\" title=\"List of NBA arenas\">Arena</a></th><td class=\"infobox-data label\"><a href=\"/wiki/Toyota_Center\" title=\"Toyota Center\">Toyota Center</a></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-header\" style=\"background: #E0E7EF; color:inherit;\">Results</th></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Record</th><td class=\"infobox-data\">34&#8211;21 (.618)</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Place</th><td class=\"infobox-data\">Division: 2nd (<a href=\"/wiki/Southwest_Division_(NBA)\" title=\"Southwest Division (NBA)\">Southwest</a>)<br />Conference: 4th (<a href=\"/wiki/Western_Conference_(NBA)\" title=\"Western Conference (NBA)\">Western</a>)<span style=\"display:none\" data-plural=\"1\"></span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\"><hr /><span class=\"plainlinks\">Stats at <b><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.basketball-reference.com/teams/HOU/2025.html\">Basketball Reference</a></b></span></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-header\" style=\"background: #E0E7EF; color:inherit;\">Local media</th></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\"><a href=\"/wiki/NBA_on_television\" title=\"NBA on television\">Television</a></th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><a href=\"/wiki/Space_City_Home_Network\" title=\"Space City Home Network\">Space City Home Network</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Radio</th><td class=\"infobox-data\"><a href=\"/wiki/KBME_(AM)\" title=\"KBME (AM)\">Sportstalk 790</a></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-below noprint\" style=\"border-top:#bbb solid 1px\"><table style=\"width:100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left;\"><a href=\"/wiki/2023%E2%80%9324_Houston_Rockets_season\" title=\"2023–24 Houston Rockets season\">&lt;&#160;2023–24</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right;\"><a href=\"/wiki/2025%E2%80%9326_Houston_Rockets_season\" title=\"2025–26 Houston Rockets season\">2025–26&#160;&gt;</a></td>\n</tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The <b>2024–25 Houston Rockets season</b> is the 58th season of the franchise in the <a href=\"/wiki/National_Basketball_Association\" title=\"National Basketball Association\">National Basketball Association</a> (NBA), and 54th season in the city of <a href=\"/wiki/Houston\" title=\"Houston\">Houston</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> After starting the regular season out 3–3, the Rockets would start to showcase serious improvements in their production to the point of becoming one of the best teams in the Western Conference throughout the season.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Draft\">Draft</h2></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1368532237\">.mw-parser-output .hatnote{font-style:italic}.mw-parser-output div.hatnote{padding-left:1.6em;margin-bottom:0.5em}.mw-parser-output .hatnote i{font-style:normal}.mw-parser-output .hatnote+.mw-empty-elt+.hatnote{margin-top:-0.5em}@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .hatnote{display:none!important}}</style><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/2024_NBA_draft\" title=\"2024 NBA draft\">2024 NBA draft</a></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable sortable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background:#c5001e; color:#fff; width:10%;\">Round\n</th>\n<th style=\"background:#c5001e; color:#fff; width:10%;\">Pick\n</th>\n<th style=\"background:#c5001e; color:#fff; width:20%;\">Player\n</th>\n<th style=\"background:#c5001e; color:#fff; width:15%;\">Position\n</th>\n<th style=\"background:#c5001e; color:#fff; width:15%;\">Nationality\n</th>\n<th style=\"background:#c5001e; color:#fff; width:20%;\">College / Club\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: center\">\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Reed_Sheppard\" title=\"Reed Sheppard\">Reed Sheppard</a>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Shooting_guard\" title=\"Shooting guard\">SG</a>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States\" title=\"United States\"><img alt=\"United States\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/a/a4/Flag_of_the_United_States.svg/40px-Flag_of_the_United_States.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/a/a4/Flag_of_the_United_States.svg/60px-Flag_of_the_United_States.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1235\" data-file-height=\"650\" /></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/United_